        "created_at": "2026-09-26T11:37:21.889Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I build AI attendance and lead-qualification engines on n8n — mine is running in production right now, not in slideware.</p>\n<p><strong>Try it before you read further</strong> — live English demo: <a href=\"https://devmosaalhaj.github.io/leadlens-poc/atendimento-ia-en.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">AI Customer Support on WhatsApp — Live demo (real engine)</a></p>\n<p>Send it any message — “how much is the plan?”, an order, or something absurd — and watch the engine panel: intent classification with confidence, lead qualification, and an honest fallback (when it doesn’t know, it says so and escalates to a human with full context — designed to never invent answers).</p>\n<p>What I deliver:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>n8n workflows with explicit error branches, retries with exponential backoff, alerting hooks — documented JSON + README, semantic versioning</li>\n<li>WhatsApp Cloud API integration (official API, signature-validated Meta webhooks, template management)</li>\n<li>Code nodes in clean JavaScript (no Python), with self-tests</li>\n<li>Full handover: your infrastructure, your repository, video walkthrough</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Background: LeadLens Studio — Integration Engineering. Architected an iPaaS engine (Reachware Studio) processing thousands of API calls/day across ERP, e-commerce and CRM. Native PT-BR, fluent EN, working ES.</p>\n<p>Engagement: US$ 35–45/h or fixed per phase (40/60 milestones). Paid trial workflow welcome — judge the handoff quality risk-free. DM me here or <a href=\"mailto:leadlens.br@proton.me\">leadlens.br@proton.me</a>.</p>",
